    sum 1.0 given ?x ?z ?step-x ?step-z ?radius where { ?obstacle obstacle position Vec3 { x: ?obstacle-x, y: ?obstacle-y, z: ?obstacle-z }; ?obstacle obstacle radius ?obstacle-radius; step (0.0 - ?step-z) ?step-x toward relative point (?obstacle-x - ?x) (?obstacle-z - ?z) projects ?projection; ?projection clamped between 0.0 and 1.0 as ?along; step (0.0 - ?step-z) ?step-x past relative point (?obstacle-x - ?x) (?obstacle-z - ?z) radius (?radius + ?obstacle-radius) along ?along blocked ?collision; ?collision = true } as ?right-obstacles
